# Experiment run directories (large); results.json is tracked explicitly
# Experiment runs: ignore the bulky regenerable artefacts (figures, embeddings,
# logs) but ALWAYS track each run's results.json. Those files are cited in the
# thesis -- friends_on backs Section 4.11's macros, so the document does not
# even compile without it, and seed43/seed44 are the evidence for the
# three-seed replication in the Threats to Validity section. A file the build
# or a claim depends on must not be ignored.
recsys_experiments/*/figures/
recsys_experiments/*/embeddings*.json
recsys_experiments/*.log
!recsys_experiments/*/results.json

